## Design System

### Color Tokens (defined in src/index.css, use via var())
```
--bg: #fafaf9
--bg-secondary: #f4f4f2
--bg-tertiary: #eeeeec
--surface: #ffffff
--border: #e4e4e2
--border-subtle: #efefed
--text-primary: #111110
--text-secondary: #6b6b67
--text-tertiary: #9a9a96
--accent: oklch(50% 0.12 240)       ← blue, primary brand color
--accent-light: oklch(96% 0.03 240)
--accent-text: oklch(45% 0.13 240)
--danger: oklch(50% 0.16 25)        ← red
--warning: oklch(60% 0.14 65)       ← amber
--success: oklch(52% 0.14 160)      ← green
--shadow-xs / --shadow-sm / --shadow-md / --shadow-lg
--radius-sm: 6px / --radius-md: 10px / --radius-lg: 16px
```

### Sidebar (Dark Theme)
The sidebar is NOT affected by the main design token system. It has its own values:
```
background: #111110
text active: #ffffff
text inactive: rgba(255,255,255,0.45)
active item bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.1)
hover item bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.05)
border color: rgba(255,255,255,0.07)
icon active: #ffffff
icon inactive: rgba(255,255,255,0.4)
```

### Typography Rules
- Headings: DM Sans, fontWeight 600, letterSpacing -0.03em to -0.04em
- Body: DM Sans, fontWeight 400, lineHeight 1.5–1.7
- Labels/overlines: DM Mono, fontSize 10-11px, textTransform uppercase, letterSpacing 0.06-0.08em
- Badges/tags: DM Mono, fontWeight 500, letterSpacing 0.02em
- Code/technical: DM Mono

### Node Colors (Knowledge Graph)
```
person   → oklch(50% 0.12 240)   blue
system   → oklch(52% 0.14 160)   green
incident → oklch(50% 0.16 25)    red
workflow → oklch(60% 0.14 65)    amber
```

