## Component Patterns

### Icon Component Usage
```jsx
// Always use the Icon component, never raw SVG inline in pages
<Icon name="graph" size={16} strokeWidth={1.5} color="currentColor" />

// Available names: logo, menu, x, chevronRight, chevronDown, arrowRight,
// grid, graph, workflow, alert, ai, database, file, reports, settings,
// search, user, send, check, lock, shield, cpu, zap, gitBranch, slack,
// messageSquare, plus, bell, home, externalLink, eye, layers
```

### Badge Component Usage
```jsx
<Badge variant="danger" size="sm">CRITICAL</Badge>
<Badge variant="accent" size="xs">Knowledge Graph</Badge>
// variants: default | accent | danger | warning | success | dark
// sizes: xs | sm | md
```

### Button Component Usage
```jsx
<Button variant="primary" size="lg" icon="arrowRight" onClick={fn}>
  Request Demo
</Button>
// variants: primary | secondary | ghost | accent | link
// sizes: sm | md | lg | xl
// icon prop is optional — renders Icon before children
```

### StatCard Usage
```jsx
<StatCard
  label="Knowledge Nodes"
  value="2,847"
  delta={12}           // optional, positive=green, negative=red
  sublabel="vs last month"
  delay={0}            // animation delay in ms, increment by 60 per card
/>
```

### DashboardShell Usage
```jsx
<DashboardShell
  currentPage="graph"
  setCurrentPage={setCurrentPage}
  title="Knowledge Graph"
  subtitle="856 nodes · 1,204 edges · Updated 4 min ago"
  actions={<Button variant="secondary" size="sm">Export</Button>}
>
  {/* page content */}
</DashboardShell>
```

