## State Management (Zustand)

Single store at `src/stores/appStore.js`. Never create additional stores.

```javascript
// Reading state in components
const currentPage = useAppStore(s => s.currentPage)
const { graphNodes, graphEdges } = useAppStore(s => ({ ... }))

// Never destructure the entire store — always select minimally
// WRONG: const store = useAppStore()
// RIGHT: const nodes = useAppStore(s => s.graphNodes)
```

Store shape:
```javascript
{
  // Navigation
  currentPage: 'landing',
  setCurrentPage: fn,

  // Graph
  graphNodes: [],
  graphEdges: [],
  selectedNode: null,
  filterType: 'all',  // all | person | system | incident | workflow
  setSelectedNode: fn,
  setFilterType: fn,

  // Assistant
  messages: [],
  isLoading: false,
  addMessage: fn,
  setLoading: fn,

  // Data
  knowledgeStats: { nodes: 0, workflows: 0, incidents: 0, sources: 0 },
  riskItems: [],
  sources: [],

  // Ingest
  ingestionStatus: null,  // null | processing | complete | error
  setIngestionStatus: fn,

  // Actions (async, call API then update state)
  fetchGraph: async fn,
  fetchRiskReport: async fn,
  fetchStats: async fn,
  sendMessage: async fn,
}
```

