## API Service Pattern

All API calls in `src/services/api.js`:

```javascript
const BASE = import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL || 'http://localhost:8000'

export async function fetchGraph() {
  const res = await fetch(`${BASE}/graph`)
  if (!res.ok) throw new Error('Failed to fetch graph')
  return res.json()
}

export async function sendQuery(question) {
  const res = await fetch(`${BASE}/query`, {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
    body: JSON.stringify({ question })
  })
  return res.json()
}
```

During Phase 1 (frontend-only), these functions return mock data instead of fetching.
Phase 3 switches them to real fetch calls — no component changes required.

