## What Cursor Should Never Do

- Generate a settings page with real content (nav item only, content = placeholder)
- Generate a reports page with real content (nav item only)
- Install react-force-graph, D3, vis-network, or any graph library
- Add dark mode logic
- Add authentication/login flows
- Add real Slack/GitHub OAuth
- Use purple gradients on white backgrounds
- Use Space Grotesk, Inter, or Poppins
- Create more than one Zustand store
- Put fetch calls inside components
